<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<!--
  App Store build entitlements: intentionally minimal (NO Network Extension,
  NO App Group). The app captures via an in-app loopback proxy + manual Wi-Fi
  proxy setup, so it is NOT a "VPN app" under App Store guideline 5.4 (which
  requires an Organization account). The VPN build uses Weaver-VPN.entitlements
  instead — see project.yml for how to switch on the VPN target.
-->
